{"id":"0ec5d35474706206","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-relation-extension.md","title":"Relation Extension Property","display":"prop-relation-extension — Relation Extension Property","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-relation-extension","aliases":["89-prop-relation-extension"],"display":"prop-relation-extension — Relation Extension Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-relation-extension]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-relation-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-relation-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-relation-extension — Relation Extension Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3771cb3ddfd32097\" href=\"?note=3771cb3ddfd32097\" title=\"89-df-relation-extension\">89-df-relation-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(W,R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal F&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\\)</span> are Kripke frames.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\\)</span> is the relation-extension predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to wR&#39;v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to wR&#39;v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\">\\(R&#39;\\)</span> preserves every edge of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> and may add new edges.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-relation-extension","status":"resolved","id":"3771cb3ddfd32097","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-relation-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F'=(W,R')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F')\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to wR'v).","display":true},{"tex":"R'","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":769,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-580","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-relation-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["3771cb3ddfd32097","c78d4bf1505bda5c"]}